     2197   define variable vss-include-info19 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     2198   on help of frame Dialog-Frame
     2199   do:
     2200     run gbl/app_help.p
     2201       (input this-procedure :file-name
     2202       ,input ''
